{"data":{"current_mention_tongjian_id":"8bfd66d5-db0e-11ef-9832-a0d3651f611f","current_paragraph_tongjian_id":"8bfd66d1-db0e-11ef-8e7f-a0d3651f611f","occurrence_page":{"anchor_paragraph_order":0,"current_page":1,"items":[{"mention_count":1,"paragraph_brief":{"brief_for":"東平國","paragraph":{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"樂，音洛；下同。","note_content_jianti_auto":"乐，音洛；下同。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":58,"tongjian_id":"951128d2-db0e-11ef-bad5-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"采菽，詩·小雅之章也。其詩曰：采菽采菽，筐之筥之；君子來朝，何錫予之。毛詩註云：菽，所以芼太牢而待君子，羊則苦，豕則薇。箋云：菽，大豆也，采其葉以爲藿。三牲，牛、羊、豕，芼以藿。正義曰：傳旣言羊則苦，豕則薇，則菽不總芼三牲；而言菽所以芼太牢者，舉牛之芼，則羊豕之苦、薇從可知矣。","note_content_jianti_auto":"采菽，诗·小雅之章也。其诗曰：采菽采菽，筐之筥之；君子来朝，何锡予之。毛诗注云：菽，所以芼太牢而待君子，羊则苦，豕则薇。笺云：菽，大豆也，采其叶以为藿。三牲，牛、羊、豕，芼以藿。正义曰：传既言羊则苦，豕则薇，则菽不总芼三牲；而言菽所以芼太牢者，举牛之芼，则羊豕之苦、薇从可知矣。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":88,"tongjian_id":"951128d3-db0e-11ef-b1c8-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"蒼","people_name_jianti_auto":"苍","start_index":6,"tongjian_id":"951128dc-db0e-11ef-ab0f-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"要，讀曰腰。蒼腰帶十圍。","note_content_jianti_auto":"要，读曰腰。苍腰带十围。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":125,"tongjian_id":"951128db-db0e-11ef-ab9d-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"東平國","place_name_jianti_auto":"东平国","resolved_place_entity_id":735,"start_index":40,"tongjian_id":"951128df-db0e-11ef-bcb4-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[],"class_tags":[],"content":"1春，正月，東平王蒼與諸王俱來朝，月餘，還國。帝臨送歸宮，悽然懷思，乃遣使手詔賜東平國中傅曰：「辭別之後，獨坐不樂，因就車歸，伏軾而吟，瞻望永懷，實勞我心。誦及采菽，以增歎息。日者問東平王：『處家何等最樂？』王言：『爲善最樂。』其言甚大，副是要腹矣。今送列侯印十九枚，諸王子年五歲已上能趨拜者，皆令帶之。」","content_fanyi":"春季，正月，东平王刘苍与诸封王一起入京朝见汉明帝，过了一个多月才返回封国。汉明帝亲自送行后回到宫中，凄然怀念，难以自止，于是派遣使者捧着亲手写的手诏赐给东平国中傅，诏书说：“朕与东平王辞别之后，独自坐着闷闷不乐，乘车回宫，伏在车轼上吟咏，瞻望远方长久怀念，实在使朕心中劳苦。吟诵《采菽》，更增添了叹息。前些时候朕问东平王：‘居家时做什么最快乐？’王说：‘做善事最快乐。’这句话十分宏大，正与他的腰腹相称啊。现在送去列侯印十九枚，东平王儿子中年龄在五岁以上、能够趋步行礼的，都让他们佩带起来。”","content_jianti_auto":"1春，正月，东平王苍与诸王俱来朝，月余，还国。帝临送归宫，凄然怀思，乃遣使手诏赐东平国中傅曰：「辞别之后，独坐不乐，因就车归，伏轼而吟，瞻望永怀，实劳我心。诵及采菽，以增叹息。日者问东平王：『处家何等最乐？』王言：『为善最乐。』其言甚大，副是要腹矣。今送列侯印十九枚，诸王子年五岁已上能趋拜者，皆令带之。」","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":3583,"number":1,"path":"资治通鉴 : 卷第四十五 (漢紀三十七) / 顯宗孝明皇帝下 / 十一年 / 第 1 段","reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"951128d1-db0e-11ef-8a67-a0d3651f611f","year_int":68,"zhang_TJZJ_id":"zttjzj_000702"},"tongjian_id":"951128d1-db0e-11ef-8a67-a0d3651f611f"},"paragraph_order":1},{"mention_count":1,"paragraph_brief":{"brief_for":"東平國","paragraph":{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"任城國","place_name_jianti_auto":"任城国","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"954b7e22-db0e-11ef-aad7-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"雒陽","place_name_jianti_auto":"雒阳","start_index":5,"tongjian_id":"954b7e23-db0e-11ef-a863-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"任城國，在雒陽東千一百里。任，音壬。","note_content_jianti_auto":"任城国，在雒阳东千一百里。任，音壬。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":24,"tongjian_id":"954b7e21-db0e-11ef-8ef6-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"東平國","place_name_jianti_auto":"东平国","place_note":"府无盐，山东东平东南","resolved_place_entity_id":735,"start_index":10,"tongjian_id":"954b7e27-db0e-11ef-b815-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[],"class_tags":[],"content":"2夏，四月，己卯，分東平國，封獻王子尚爲任城王。","content_fanyi":"夏季，四月己卯日，朝廷分割东平国，封东平献王的儿子刘尚为任城王。","content_jianti_auto":"2夏，四月，己卯，分东平国，封献王子尚为任城王。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":3712,"number":2,"path":"资治通鉴 : 卷第四十六 (漢紀三十八) / 肅宗孝章皇帝上 / 元和元年 / 第 2 段","reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":1,"tongjian_id":"954b7e20-db0e-11ef-869e-a0d3651f611f","year_int":84},"tongjian_id":"954b7e20-db0e-11ef-869e-a0d3651f611f"},"paragraph_order":2}],"page_size":10,"total_pages":1,"total_paragraphs":2},"place_name":"東平國"},"message":"success","success":true}